  "details": "Ever since the eac update, steam does not seem to recognize that vrchat has closed. Both the vrchat main process, aswell as the eac process will no longer be active; however steam seems to still think that vrchat is active. The only workaround i have seen so far is to force close steam, and then restart it after it shuts down. which can be rather inconvient when in vr.",
